/-!
# A limit-preserving criterion for representability by algebraic spaces

**Stacks 07WH**: a 1-morphism of categories fibred in groupoids over the big fppf site of `S`
is representable by algebraic spaces when the structure morphism of the target is limit
preserving on objects, the fibre products over affine `V` locally of finite presentation over
`S` are algebraic spaces of bounded size, and source and target are Zariski stacks. The main
result, `AlgebraicGeometry.Stack.isRepresentableByAlgebraicSpaces_of_limitPreservingOnObjects`,
is in `Representability`.
-/
